#~ msgid ""
#~ "We found some supplies when searching the camp, but nothing much. What is "
#~ "to be done with them?"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Ƿe fundon andƿiste þa þa ƿe þurhsohte þa geteld, ac na fela. Hƿæt agan ƿe "
